@host = http://localhost:5245
@employeePassword = {{$processEnv EXPENSEHUB_USER_PASSWORD}}

# CP3 — relatórios em segundo plano. Tokens são obtidos por login em cada execução (nada é persistido aqui).
# Pré-requisito: usuários employee-a, employee-b e auditor cadastrados com as roles Employee/Employee/Auditor
# (fluxo de cadastro e atribuição de roles em ExpenseHub.Api.http ou scripts/cp3/Invoke-Cp3Seed.ps1).

### Login Employee A
# @name loginA
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "employee-a@expensehub.local",
  "password": "{{employeePassword}}"
}

###
@tokenA = {{loginA.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Login Employee B
# @name loginB
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "employee-b@expensehub.local",
  "password": "{{employeePassword}}"
}

###
@tokenB = {{loginB.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Login Auditor
# @name loginAuditor
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "auditor@expensehub.local",
  "password": "{{employeePassword}}"
}

###
@tokenAuditor = {{loginAuditor.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Employee A solicita Mine -> 202 + Location
# @name requestMine
POST {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromDate": "2026-09-01",
  "toDate": "2026-09-30",
  "scope": "Mine"
}

###
@reportId = {{requestMine.response.body.$.id}}

### Acompanha até Completed
GET {{host}}/api/reports/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### Lista somente as próprias solicitações
GET {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### Baixa a planilha (200 + .xlsx quando Completed; 409 enquanto Pending/Processing)
GET {{host}}/api/reports/{{reportId}}/excel
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### Auditor solicita Global -> 202
# @name requestGlobal
POST {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAuditor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromDate": "2026-09-01",
  "toDate": "2026-09-30",
  "scope": "Global"
}

###
@globalReportId = {{requestGlobal.response.body.$.id}}

### Auditor acompanha o próprio relatório Global
GET {{host}}/api/reports/{{globalReportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAuditor}}

### Negativo: sem token -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/reports

### Negativo: Employee pede Global -> 403
POST {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromDate": "2026-09-01",
  "toDate": "2026-09-30",
  "scope": "Global"
}

### Negativo: Auditor (sem Employee) pede Mine -> 403
POST {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAuditor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromDate": "2026-09-01",
  "toDate": "2026-09-30",
  "scope": "Mine"
}

### Negativo: período invertido -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromDate": "2026-09-30",
  "toDate": "2026-09-01",
  "scope": "Mine"
}

### Negativo: escopo inválido -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromDate": "2026-09-01",
  "toDate": "2026-09-30",
  "scope": "Everyone"
}

### Negativo: data inválida -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromDate": "2026-02-30",
  "toDate": "2026-09-30",
  "scope": "Mine"
}

### Negativo: ownerId enviado pelo cliente -> 400 (campo não aceito)
POST {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromDate": "2026-09-01",
  "toDate": "2026-09-30",
  "scope": "Mine",
  "ownerId": "outro-usuario"
}

### Negativo: Employee B consulta relatório de A -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/reports/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

### Negativo: Employee B baixa Excel de A -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/reports/{{reportId}}/excel
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

### Negativo: Auditor consulta relatório de A -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/reports/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAuditor}}

### Negativo: Auditor baixa Excel de A -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/reports/{{reportId}}/excel
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAuditor}}
